For example, suppose your `sales` collection contains:

```
{ customer: "Amit", amount: 500 }
{ customer: "Amit", amount: 800 }
{ customer: "Amit", amount: 300 }
{ customer: "Rahul", amount: 700 }
{ customer: "Rahul", amount: 900 }
```

Using `$first` and `$last`

```
db.sales.aggregate([
  {
    $group: {
      _id: "$customer",
      firstAmount: { $first: "$amount" },
      lastAmount: { $last: "$amount" }
    }
  }
])
```
